TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Claude] Snapshot: Choose this quarter's watch cases by the rule
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Claude (claude)\n\ndocs/RESEARCH_PLAN.md\, "Pilot 
 watch cases": every flaw published in the quarter just ended with CVSS 9.0
  or more that at least one national CERT (CISA\, NCSC UK\, CERT-EU\, BSI\,
  ANSSI\, CERT-In) issued an alert or advisory for\; if more than two\, two
  by the seeded draw. Each gets an inquiry-log entry (docs/INQUIRIES.md) an
 d a case note in docs/cases/.\n\nSource: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Claude
END:VEVENT
