DTSTART:20280315T150000Z
DTEND:20280315T163000Z
SUMMARY:[Paul] Snapshot: Annual review and change window
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Paul (author)\n\nThe one time each year core rules
  may change (docs/CHANGE_POLICY.md). Promotion candidates\; the AI-credit 
 rule\; the inquiry log (docs/INQUIRIES.md) and the year's exploratory addi
 tions\; any change run side by side for four quarters. From 2028 (the annu
 al wrap-up): review the annual check of the previous year's free results a
 gainst reference scan data and published insurance-claims and ransom-payme
 nt figures (pre-registration section 13)\, and approve it for publishing.\
 n\nSource: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Author
END:VEVENT
